value values string consent_body = To install into the other system slot (%1$s), the update copies the projector’s XGIMI firmware (boot, bootloader, display and audio firmware, configuration) unchanged from the running slot (%2$s). Nothing is modified, decrypted or sent anywhere, and vbmeta is never written. XGIMI’s own updates do the same. Calibration and settings partitions are never touched.
